## Control {{controlId}}: Ensure Managers, System Administrators, and Users Are Made Aware of Security Risks

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization ensures security awareness within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through formal training programs, attack simulations, and policy acknowledgments managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if attackSimulationsActive}}
**Attack Simulation Training:**
{{attackSimulationsCount}} attack simulations conducted to validate user security awareness:
