**Security Awareness Program:**
- **Initial Training:** All users complete CUI handling and security awareness training within 30 days of account provisioning
- **Annual Refresher:** Mandatory annual training covering CUI marking, handling, incident reporting, and emerging threats
- **Policy Acknowledgment:** Users acknowledge Acceptable Use Policy, CUI Handling Procedures, and Incident Reporting requirements
- **Training Topics:** Phishing recognition, password security, removable media risks, social engineering, CUI marking per 32 CFR Part 2002, incident reporting procedures

**Operational Procedure:**
- **Action:** Track training completion; follow up with non-compliant users; update training content annually
- **Frequency:** Annual training cycle with 30-day completion window
- **Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}
- **Documentation:** Security Awareness Training Program v1.0, Training Completion Records

**Review Frequency:** Annually by ISSO

**Verification Method:** Examine training completion records, attack simulation results, policy acknowledgment records, and training content review history.

